    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWhen all the planets in the galaxy succumb to the mysterious forces, only the most powerful of wizards can save their inhabitants and face the great evil behind this destruction. Resting in the crystal fields of Cristalia, the mighty Zavior is called back to action and is ready to face all types of danger to protect these innocent lives\u2026 or at least try.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/b306fdafc123396dedff12b1760bccf9.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizavior</strong> is a<strong> 3D platformer game with arcade aspects</strong>, such as time based stages and an endless game mode game. With a fun narrative and memorable characters, you player will take the role of the mighty-but-retired wizard <strong>Zavior</strong> in a quest throughout multiple planets. <strong>Save each planet's inhabitants by collecting Energy Crystals that power up Zavior's powerful Spells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/0a88b4092fba28a443fc4341176713d9.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platform mechanics;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique planets to save + epic final challenge;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird aliens that you\u2019ll grow to love;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually beautiful &amp; strong narrative;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and engaging soundtrack;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving HUB that changes during the story;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling story with more than 30 minutes of frame-by-frame animated cutscenes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectables and achievements;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8ee59ee7ad7eaa92bcdb2eb2f31c48ac.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the wizard Zavior in his saga to save the inhabitants of Planets doomed to destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique scenarios with multiple levels that have its unique set of hazards and challenges! + An epic final encounter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 33 different levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 minutes of 2D animated cutscenes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE MODE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless sequence of stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic test of game and controls skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoreboard to keep track of your best runs!   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f7845185123006b22d2b60ae9d58819e.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cristalia: </strong>Wizavior\u2019s home planet works as a HUB for all the aliens that you rescue! Explore your home planet and interact with the rescued aliens. You\u2019ll see changes inside your house and on the planet as you progress and through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aurar: </strong>Completely made of ice, Aurar is known for its constant heavy snow storms and for being home to the fierce, terrible and cruel creatures that dwell in the shadows of the caves. At least that's what they say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliria: </strong>With huge tornadoes and strong sandstorms, it is the perfect home for the delirians that inhabit it. Tornado surfing is the local favorite sport. Or is it the mirage hunt? Or the jump on the sand? Ahnn... You tell me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phyto: </strong>The entire ecosystem of Phyto revolves around the Giant Bonsai that is cared for by its small and countless inhabitants. Phytonians are famous for their pollen, inspiring the creation of the most colorful programs on the Universal Television Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xoferasta: </strong>The inhabitants of Xoferasta venerate the Planet, which is entirely formed by active volcanoes. The xoferastian civilization inhabits both the outside and the inside of volcanoes and bathes in the molten lava rivers that cut across the Planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/5ce4888f3bba8f7077b9e64a6eebf809.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 2009, Split has established itself as an award-winning animation and gaming studio. We create content in various formats for clients such as Cartoon Network, Mauricio de Sousa Produ\u00e7\u00f5es, Cartoonito, Disney Junior, Sanrio, Instituto Ayrton Senna, Canal Futura, Riot Games and many others. Our original projects are treated as intellectual properties: we don\u2019t see them merely as series, films, or games, but as 360\u00ba content that can expand across multiple media platforms. This includes works like<i> WeeBoom, Tekoha: A Tale Among The Stars, Boomies,</i> and, of course,<i> Wizavior.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWhen all the planets in the galaxy succumb to the mysterious forces, only the most powerful of wizards can save their inhabitants and face the great evil behind this destruction. Resting in the crystal fields of Cristalia, the mighty Zavior is called back to action and is ready to face all types of danger to protect these innocent lives\u2026 or at least try.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/b306fdafc123396dedff12b1760bccf9.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizavior</strong> is a<strong> 3D platformer game with arcade aspects</strong>, such as time based stages and an endless game mode game. With a fun narrative and memorable characters, you player will take the role of the mighty-but-retired wizard <strong>Zavior</strong> in a quest throughout multiple planets. <strong>Save each planet's inhabitants by collecting Energy Crystals that power up Zavior's powerful Spells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/0a88b4092fba28a443fc4341176713d9.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platform mechanics;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique planets to save + epic final challenge;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird aliens that you\u2019ll grow to love;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually beautiful &amp; strong narrative;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and engaging soundtrack;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving HUB that changes during the story;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling story with more than 30 minutes of frame-by-frame animated cutscenes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectables and achievements;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8ee59ee7ad7eaa92bcdb2eb2f31c48ac.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the wizard Zavior in his saga to save the inhabitants of Planets doomed to destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique scenarios with multiple levels that have its unique set of hazards and challenges! + An epic final encounter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 33 different levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 minutes of 2D animated cutscenes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE MODE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless sequence of stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic test of game and controls skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoreboard to keep track of your best runs!   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f7845185123006b22d2b60ae9d58819e.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/8fb57c1ba3a804b6b29865b611932465.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cristalia: </strong>Wizavior\u2019s home planet works as a HUB for all the aliens that you rescue! Explore your home planet and interact with the rescued aliens. You\u2019ll see changes inside your house and on the planet as you progress and through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/f812c9c8e66655f2969f87c35882b12e.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aurar: </strong>Completely made of ice, Aurar is known for its constant heavy snow storms and for being home to the fierce, terrible and cruel creatures that dwell in the shadows of the caves. At least that's what they say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/c1d37b2a12c8c0d9965a1f933b0878bf.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliria: </strong>With huge tornadoes and strong sandstorms, it is the perfect home for the delirians that inhabit it. Tornado surfing is the local favorite sport. Or is it the mirage hunt? Or the jump on the sand? Ahnn... You tell me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/44bf146c215c3c3849681b2378e9d31d.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phyto: </strong>The entire ecosystem of Phyto revolves around the Giant Bonsai that is cared for by its small and countless inhabitants. Phytonians are famous for their pollen, inspiring the creation of the most colorful programs on the Universal Television Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.poster.avif?t=1752615367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.webm?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/607815388f3e7b4465166f2432a1dc57.mp4?t=1752615367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xoferasta: </strong>The inhabitants of Xoferasta venerate the Planet, which is entirely formed by active volcanoes. The xoferastian civilization inhabits both the outside and the inside of volcanoes and bathes in the molten lava rivers that cut across the Planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458590/extras/5ce4888f3bba8f7077b9e64a6eebf809.avif?t=1752615367\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 2009, Split has established itself as an award-winning animation and gaming studio. We create content in various formats for clients such as Cartoon Network, Mauricio de Sousa Produ\u00e7\u00f5es, Cartoonito, Disney Junior, Sanrio, Instituto Ayrton Senna, Canal Futura, Riot Games and many others. Our original projects are treated as intellectual properties: we don\u2019t see them merely as series, films, or games, but as 360\u00ba content that can expand across multiple media platforms. This includes works like<i> WeeBoom, Tekoha: A Tale Among The Stars, Boomies,</i> and, of course,<i> Wizavior.</i></p>",
